---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Joe Sheldon | Redfin Senior Agent"
description: "Greater Seattle real estate insights, hyper-local market stats, and buyer & seller guides with Redfin Senior Agent Joe Sheldon."
permalink: /index.html
---

<div class="layout-container" style="padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 6rem;">
  
    {# Section 1.0: Profile #}
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
        
        <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <img src="https://assets.myseattlesearch.com/repomove/joe.webp" alt="Joe Sheldon" width="150" height="150" style="border-radius: var(--border-radius-squircle); object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);">
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-overline">Redfin Senior Agent</div>
        <h1 class="text-display" style="margin-top: 0.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">{{ stats.short_name }}</h1>
        <p class="text-body-secondary">Serving North King & South Snohomish Counties, WA</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 3rem; margin: 2rem 0;">
            <div>
                <div class="text-data-huge text-primary-charcoal">{{ stats['Closed Sales'] }}</div>
                <div class="text-overline" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">TRANSACTIONS</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="text-data-huge text-primary-charcoal">${{ (stats['Total Sales Volume'] / 1000000) | round(0, "floor") }}M</div>
                <div class="text-overline" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">VOLUME</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="text-data-huge text-primary-charcoal">{{ stats['Average Rating'] }}</div>
                <div class="text-overline" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">AVG RATING</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <a href="tel:{{ stats.universal_contact_phone }}" class="title-link" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">(206) 657-7493</a>
            <a href="mailto:joe.sheldon@redfin.com" class="title-link" style="display: block;">joe.sheldon@redfin.com</a>
        </div>

        <div class="drawer-actions-stack" style="max-width: 360px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <a href="/contact.vcf" class="btn-contact-secondary">Save My Contact Info</a>
            <a href="https://www.redfin.com/real-estate-agents/joe-sheldon?loyalty=true" class="btn-contact-primary" target="_blank">View My Redfin Profile</a>
            <a href="/sales/" class="btn-contact-secondary">Listings & Sales</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    {# Section 2.0: Educational Resource #}
    <div style="margin: 4rem 0;">
      {% set resource_title = "Free Home Buying Classes" %}
      {% set resource_content = "Join us to learn everything you need to know about navigating the current real estate market." %}
      {% set resource_button_text = "View Upcoming Classes & Register" %}
      {% set resource_button_url = "/events/" %}
      {% include "components/widget/resource-card.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    {# Section 3.0: Video Player #}
    <div style="margin: 4rem 0;">
      {% set video_title = "Won't you be my neighbor?" %}
      {% set video_id = "e3o5FIXoK84" %}
      {% set video_poster = "https://assets.myseattlesearch.com/repomove/youtubeneighborthumbnail.webp" %}
      {% set video_label = "Won't you be my neighbor video" %}
      {% include "components/widget/video-player.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    {# Section 4.0: Client Reviews #}
    <div style="margin: 4rem 0;">
      {% set reviews_data = homepageReviews %}
      {% include "components/widget/reviews.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    {# Section 5.0: About Me #}
    <div style="margin-top: 4rem; max-width: 860px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <h2 class="text-section-title" style="text-align: center; border: none; padding: 0; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 2rem;">About Me</h2>
      <div class="text-body">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">I transplanted to Seattle in 2009, and the Pacific Northwest has become my new home. I am in love with its natural beauty and the abundance of year-round activities. Having grew up around the construction business, I developed a deep understanding of what makes a good home. My real estate passion comes from my desire to help you navigate the journey of purchasing one of the largest yet most personal items of your lifetime.</p>
        <p>I joined Redfin in 2014 to pursue this passion relentlessly. I like my customers to think of me as their coach throughout the entire process. My team and I will give you expert guidance at every turn, and I'll be by your side through the ups and downs. You can expect me to provide honest advice and tireless advocacy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

</div>

{# Modular Script Injections #}
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/youtube-lite.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/local-reviews.js"></script>